Test connection is not established for the cipher suite
TLS_DHE_RSA_WITH_AES_256_CBC_SHA256.

This cipher suite is not listed as supported for TLSv1.2. This implementation
considers this cipher suite as disallowed, although it is not mentioned in the
standard (7.3) as explicitly disallowed. Reason is: the standard says the list
of disallowed cipher suites is not limited.

Security events:
- alarm: disallowed TLSv1.2 cipher suite proposed

Expected:
- connection is not established for the cipher suite required by the client
